# NEXORA — PRD 07: RECOMMENDATION INTELLIGENCE ENGINE

## 1. ROLE

Act as a senior AI product architect, recommendation systems engineer, knowledge graph specialist, machine learning engineer, and educational technology developer.

You are extending an existing NEXORA application built using Google AI Studio Build Mode.

Your task is to build an intelligent, explainable, evidence-based recommendation engine connecting student profiles, competencies, learning pathways, and industry opportunities.

You must inspect and reuse the existing application architecture from PRD 01–06.

Do not create a new application.

Do not replace existing authentication, database, design system, or portal functionality.

